{"id":105,"slug":"ma-jain-zh","resourceId":56,"nameNative":"马坚译（中文）","nameAr":"ما جيان","nameEn":"Chinese Translation (Ma Jian)","lang":"zh","source":"Quran.com API v4","sourceUrl":"https://quran.com","verses":[{"verseNumber":1,"verseKey":"105:1","text":". 难道你不知道你的主怎样处治象的主人们吗？"},{"verseNumber":2,"verseKey":"105:2","text":"难道他没有使他们的计谋, 变成无益的吗？"},{"verseNumber":3,"verseKey":"105:3","text":"他曾派遣成群的鸟去伤他们,"},{"verseNumber":4,"verseKey":"105:4","text":"以粘土石射击他们,"},{"verseNumber":5,"verseKey":"105:5","text":"使他们变成吃剩的干草一样。"}]}